// Hats, hoods and helmets, drawn over the hair. A hood is in the accent slot (x y z), metal in the metal slot (k l n).

legend G leaf.1
legend D leaf.2
legend F cloth_pink.0

// A cowl that frames the face and drapes the shoulders (the oracle, the shade, the necromancer).
sprite hat/hood 16 24

